---
import CaseLayout from '../../components/CaseLayout.astro';
---
<CaseLayout
  title="Keeper"
  description="Keeper — remember every birthday."
  label="Personal Project // Web App"
  cover="/assets/projects/keeper/cover.webp"
  coverAlt="Keeper — remember every birthday"
  meta={[
    { label: 'Role', value: 'Solo, Design &amp; Build' },
    { label: 'Platform', value: 'Installable web app' },
  ]}
  action={{ label: 'Open Keeper at keeper.paramore.design', href: 'https://keeper.paramore.design' }}
>
  <p>
    <strong>Remember every Birthday.</strong>
  </p>


  <p>
    An idea I had carried around for a long time and finally made real. The first generated
    pass worked, technically &mdash; it stored dates and showed them back. Getting from there
    to something I would actually open on a Tuesday morning meant redoing the flows, the
    typography, and all the small moments in between. That part does not come for free.
  </p>
</CaseLayout>
